message: "If you reference this project, cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Masterbuilders Site Diary"
abstract: >-
  A phone-first, offline-capable daily site diary for a paving and construction
  crew. The app follows the paper form, minimises typing, stores reports locally
  in IndexedDB, and generates a branded PDF. This repository is a working demo;
  the cloud backend is a funded, planned phase.
type: software
